nts that happened for what they are (took a long time).rape, abuse, molestation, violation, betrayal. I was just a child. I did not know better #MeToo","userId":199582794,"media":null,"username":"Youngafriqueen","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":14.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":38,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":14.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1009046466017550336,"date":1529410399000,"rawContent":"Have you ever  looked up people who have hurt you in the past, whether on Facebook or  elsewhere, particularly a bully, abuser, molester, rapist etc. Ruined  your whole life and they just forget. Where are they now?Do they deserve  to be happy? #abuse #MeToo #SpeakOut #rape","userId":199582794,"media":null,"username":"Youngafriqueen","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":13.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":39,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":13.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0}]